WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:02.147
What business do you have?

00:02.720 --> 00:04.387
This foreign official Chu Maolun

00:04.600 --> 00:05.640
Once served in Xuan Kingdom

00:05.720 --> 00:07.387
As prefect of Shuoyang Prefecture

00:07.480 --> 00:08.720
This area around Yiyang

00:08.800 --> 00:11.133
Was once under this foreign official's jurisdiction

00:11.560 --> 00:12.000
I heard

00:12.080 --> 00:14.480
Prince of Jin led the royal army north

00:14.560 --> 00:16.480
This time I risk death to come

00:16.560 --> 00:18.000
To offer Prince of Jin

00:18.080 --> 00:20.480
A strategy to lift the siege of Yiyang

00:20.560 --> 00:21.480
I ask the general

00:21.600 --> 00:24.600
To allow us to enter the city for detailed discussion

